  "correctValue": "48",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/ac692d6d-86c3-4148-9b35-41698e9e2db0-image.png\" style=\"width: 299px; height: 225px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><msup><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mfrac></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>logk</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mfrac><mi>logP</mi></math></p><p>Slope&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>So&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>.</p><p>Intercept&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>logk</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.477</mo></math></p><p>So&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>Antilog</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.477</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>So&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><msup><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mfrac></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.04</mo></mrow></mfenced>